{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんが三日間泊まりに来るって言ってたけど、実はね…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三日も泊まってないの。泣\n昨日はゆったんとお泊りしました。\nベッド別だったからぐっすり♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか皆さん！\n私がせいらりんの布団取ったって思ってる人たくさんいるけど、取ってないからね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとベッド借りただけ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんみたいに布団は取ったりしません！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝相良い方です(｀ω´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何なら一緒に寝てみます？\n布団取らない自信あります。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんと言えば、相変わらずお尻を触ってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前お仕事の間、ずーっとプニプに触ってきて、その光景を後ろで見てたスタッフさんに注意されてました笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ慣れてきたよね…笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁぁ！\n今隣にゆったんいるんだけど、私の顔で遊んできます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻に指突っ込んできたり唇触ってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあ…(´･ω･｀)\n私のことどれだけ好きなんこのコは…(はぁと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこの前の私服載せるね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/28/dvc00786.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、ポーチ見つかりません（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんどこかの駅のトイレに置いてきた(；；)\n悲しいわ。。。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、この前の問題の答えは上から『まいやん ゆったん あすか』でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番下って答えた方がたくさんいたけど、一番上(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構面白いから、また今度誰かの腕で問題出そうかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もあと3日！\n今日も一日頑張りましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/28/dvc00785.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}